cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GPUAlert in your work, please cite the paper below."
title: "GPUAlert"
abstract: >-
  GPUAlert is a command-line wrapper for GPU and Slurm training jobs. It runs
  an unmodified command, keeps durable logs, classifies why the job failed
  (CUDA out of memory, NCCL errors, segfaults, OOM killer, missing modules and
  others) and emails the result with logs and artifacts attached. No code
  changes to the training script are needed.
type: software
authors:
